### GET health check
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/health

### GET 404
GET http://localhost:8080


### POSTS - create
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "post: {{$random.uuid}}",
  "content": "hey guys this is my post number: {{$random.integer()}}",
  "tags": ["tag1"]
}

### POSTS - find
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/posts/7


### POSTS - delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/posts/5

### POSTS - update
PATCH http://localhost:8080/v1/posts/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "hey guys this a updated post",
  "tags": ["updated"]
}